@startuml Change_Status_Sequence
actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Интерфейс" as UI
participant "Контроллер" as Controller
participant "Сервис сериалов" as SeriesService
participant "Хранилище\n(localStorage)" as DB

User -> UI: Выбирает новый статус\n(Запланировано/Смотрю/\nПросмотрено/Брошено)
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Controller: changeStatus(series_id, new_status)
activate Controller

Controller -> SeriesService: updateStatus(series_id, new_status)
activate SeriesService

SeriesService -> DB: UPDATE User_Series\nSET status = new_status\nWHERE user_series_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> SeriesService: rows_affected
deactivate DB

SeriesService --> Controller: SuccessResponse()
deactivate SeriesService
Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI: Обновить карточку сериала
UI --> User: Показать новый статус
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
